      "writtenOn": "2022-05-27T12:45:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Due to `ctx.CreateModule` (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/hooks.go;l\u003d134;drc\u003df31c90050cf47cc8a46aefb21beff628ef90ad9b), ModuleType() can be suffixed, it can be preferable to either determine type based on something specific to the factory or instead check for a prefix",
