      "writtenOn": "2022-05-27T18:43:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this also mean that our [implementation](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/genrule/genrule.go;l\u003d886?q\u003dgenrule.go) for `genrule` is not complete?\n\nIf I\u0027m following the code and comment correctly,\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/module.go;l\u003d83\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/genrule/genrule.go;l\u003d65?q\u003dgenrule.go, `ModuleType()` will return `gensrcs` which is what get passed into `RegisterModuleType`.\n\nAm I misunderstanding something here?",
